mode: "100644"
text: "# Stickers, sequences + two worked examples\n\n## Pick the sticker by goal\n| Goal | Sticker | Note |\n|---|---|---|\n| Quick feedback / opinion | Poll or Slider | low-friction; binary or 0–100 |\n| Educate / segment audience | Quiz | one right answer; reveal teaches |\n| Start conversations (→ DMs) | Question box | spin answers into a follow-up AMA |\n| Real deadline / launch | Countdown | tap-to-subscribe = warm retarget list |\n| Drive traffic | Link sticker | add a \"Tap here\" overlay; end of sequence |\n| Social proof / participation | UGC reshare / \"add yours\" | reshare tags with a thank-you |\n| Exclusivity / warm inner circle | Close Friends drop (green ring) | VIP/early access; invite in via a public Story |\n\n## The sequence template (one goal)\n```\nF1  Hook — problem or outcome (sound-off; the reason to stay)\nF2  Proof — one stat / step / before-after / BTS moment\nF3  Sticker — poll/quiz/question (turn watchers into tappers)\nF4  Payoff — the answer / the takeaway\nF5  Action — ONE next step (link sticker + \"Tap here\", or reply prompt)\n```\nMini-series: split a tutorial across 3 days, each installment a distinct takeaway + a hook for the next.\n\n## Highlights\nGroup proven sequences into **Highlights** with clear covers + context (e.g. \"Start here\", \"FAQs\",\n\"Wins\"). The evergreen tail on a 24-hour surface; refresh as content improves.\n\n## Worked example 1 — value mini-tutorial → link (blunt indie-founder voice, 5 frames)\n```\nGOAL: clicks to the new guide\nF1 (hook): \"Most freelancers overpay tax. One missed step.\" [sound-off text card]\nF2 (proof): \"I moved 30% of every invoice to a second account. Saved a brutal April.\" [BTS clip]\nF3 (sticker): Quiz — \"How much should you set aside? 15% / 30% / 45%\" (answer: 30%)\nF4 (payoff): \"30%. Boring. Works.\"\nF5 (action): Link sticker -> guide + \"Tap here 👆\" overlay\nAFTER: Highlight under \"Money\". DM anyone who replies with a question.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — BTS + question → DMs (warm studio voice, 4 frames)\n```\nGOAL: replies (start conversations)\nF1 (hook): \"Tax season making your stomach drop? You're not alone.\" [soft photo]\nF2 (proof): \"Here's the one rule we give every client.\" [desk clip]\nF3 (sticker): Question box — \"What's the part of tax that stresses you most?\"\nF4 (action): \"Reply and I'll send you the exact step for your situation.\" [DM prompt]\nAFTER: answer each reply personally in DMs; spin common answers into tomorrow's AMA sequence.\n```\n\nBoth: read brand-profile + voice-builder first; one goal; sound-off legible; one sticker; one clear\naction; Highlight + DM plan. Frames designed in `image-prompt`/`ideogram`/`nano-banana`; published via\n`scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (base frames) with stickers added natively in-app.\n"
